{"duration": 54.671, "exact_word_timing": true, "lines": [{"beat": 0, "text": "A worker spread lime across Thames mud while London choked on sewage.", "start": 0.05, "end": 3.259}, {"beat": 0, "text": "The river had become London's open drain.", "start": 3.339, "end": 5.344}, {"beat": 1, "text": "The lime worker returned at low tide, day after day.", "start": 5.544, "end": 8.125}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Earlier sewer plans had been ignored because the costs were too high.", "start": 8.205, "end": 11.192}, {"beat": 1, "text": "Now the stink could no longer be ignored.", "start": 11.272, "end": 13.043}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Queen Victoria and Prince Albert tried a pleasure cruise on the Thames.", "start": 13.243, "end": 16.227}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Queen Victoria and Prince Albert returned to shore within minutes.", "start": 16.307, "end": 19.184}, {"beat": 2, "text": "The press named it the Great Stink.", "start": 19.264, "end": 20.756}, {"beat": 2, "text": "Members of Parliament fled the Commons chamber.", "start": 20.836, "end": 22.809}, {"beat": 3, "text": "You see, it was like a hot, full rubbish bin in a sealed room.", "start": 23.009, "end": 25.803}, {"beat": 3, "text": "The worker could hide the smell, but not the waste.", "start": 25.883, "end": 27.909}, {"beat": 3, "text": "Londoners feared the stench would spread cholera.", "start": 27.989, "end": 29.93}, {"beat": 4, "text": "London's old sewers emptied straight into the Thames.", "start": 30.13, "end": 32.508}, {"beat": 4, "text": "More people and flushing toilets sent more waste into broken pipes.", "start": 32.588, "end": 35.956}, {"beat": 4, "text": "Hot, dry weather dropped the river level and left raw sewage on the banks.", "start": 36.036, "end": 39.424}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Joseph Bazalgette built sloping sewers that carried waste east, beyond the city.", "start": 39.624, "end": 43.333}, {"beat": 5, "text": "Pumping stations lifted sewage into higher pipes.", "start": 43.413, "end": 45.696}, {"beat": 6, "text": "But bad air wasn't the killer. Contaminated water was.", "start": 45.896, "end": 48.941}, {"beat": 6, "text": "The stench simply forced Parliament to act.", "start": 49.021, "end": 50.961}, {"beat": 6, "text": "Those sewers still carry waste for over nine million Londoners.", "start": 51.041, "end": 53.771}], "words": [{"w": "A", "start": 0.14, "end": 0.165, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "worker", "start": 0.215, "end": 0.44, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "spread", "start": 0.49, "end": 0.665, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "lime", "start": 0.715, "end": 0.915, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "across", "start": 0.94, "end": 1.115, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "Thames", "start": 1.165, "end": 1.365, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "mud", "start": 1.415, "end": 1.815, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "while", "start": 1.89, "end": 2.015, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "London", "start": 2.04, "end": 2.215, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "choked", "start": 2.265, "end": 2.465, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "on", "start": 2.49, "end": 2.565, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "sewage.", "start": 2.64, "end": 3.229, "line": 0, "beat": 0}, {"w": "The", "start": 3.408, "end": 3.458, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "river", "start": 3.483, "end": 3.658, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "had", "start": 3.683, "end": 3.758, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "become", "start": 3.783, "end": 4.083, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "London's", "start": 4.158, "end": 4.408, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "open", "start": 4.458, "end": 4.683, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "drain.", "start": 4.733, "end": 5.344, "line": 1, "beat": 0}, {"w": "The", "start": 5.634, "end": 5.684, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "lime", "start": 5.734, "end": 5.959, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "worker", "start": 5.984, "end": 6.209, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "returned", "start": 6.234, "end": 6.509, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "at", "start": 6.534, "end": 6.584, "line": 2, "beat": 1}, {"w": "low", "start": 6.634, "end": 6.784, "l